{"version":1,"content":"<p>保持白皙透亮的肌膚可說毫不容易，尤其黑頭粉刺最為惱人。</p><p>近期韓網便出現了一套全新的去黑頭技巧，更只需要準備化妝棉及卸妝膏便能輕鬆溶解黑頭，使肌膚瞬間變得嫩滑無瑕。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;方法非常簡單，只需要準備日常濕敷的化</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:22:28.818013+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T08:00:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:18:10.210420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T08:18:10.210420+00:00","content_hash":"fab72f0a9294a5b876bb5c21ce9c34d54cae69b3fa53efd092c42b4fe5e379f8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}